24,2,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
25,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems our grants are quite short-term, and the roads north of the river are unreliable in winter. We should be careful about services that depend on travel.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The outer wards have lost their bus links, making the library very distant for some. Also, people are using the catalogue late at night, long after we close.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Guess what? We tried digitizing photos before and it was a mess, but some evening groups from six years ago are still going! And outreach was super popular.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The grant structure is indeed precarious, shifting to the operating budget after a year. Interestingly, our vehicle costs overran significantly last year.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Minako,,"We have skilled volunteers for repairs, but we lack staff trained to supervise outside facilitators. Also, we've lost our power tool certification expert.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, if the buses are gone, a mobile service sounds lovely, but @Benjamin mentioned the vehicle costs are high.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"True, but the need is urgent. If they can't reach us, the library doesn't exist for them.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Rin,,"But the outreach stops had so many people! We should do something that goes to them, like the old programs.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,High running costs and short-term grants make a mobile service a financial risk. We need something more stable.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Minako,,"A workshop would use our volunteers, but without certification or supervision, it's a liability.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Shizue,,Perhaps something that doesn't require a vehicle or a specialized building?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, would language circles require the kind of supervision you're worried about?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Rin,,I just want something that actually works and doesn't get forgotten like the photo project!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, your discovery about the evening groups suggests that community-led, low-overhead programs are the most resilient.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Minako,,Language circles would likely need those outside facilitators I mentioned. We aren't equipped to manage them.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Benjamin. Let's look for the path of least resistance and most peace.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I still worry about the people in the outer wards.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Rin,,Let's just pick the one that people will actually use!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,We must balance the desire for outreach with the reality of our budget and staffing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Minako,,I will support the option that places the least unsustainable burden on the staff.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,3,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
46,3,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
