49,3,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
50,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"We have a Mobile Branch, a Maker Workshop, Language Circles, and a Digital Archive. The Mobile Branch is too risky with the roads and costs.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The Mobile Branch solves the bus issue, but the Digital Archive helps those who use the catalogue at midnight.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Rin,,The Digital Archive sounds like that failed photo project! I don't like it. Let's do the Mobile Branch or the Workshop!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The Digital Archive is a capital expense from the endowment, which is safer than the operating budget. However, the Mobile Branch is a financial drain.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Minako,,The Workshop is impossible without a certified technician. Language Circles require supervision we don't have.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"The Digital Archive seems the most stable, as it doesn't depend on roads or new staff training.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It doesn't help the people who can't get to a computer, but it is a permanent resource.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Rin,,But it's boring! What about the Mobile Branch? Please?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, logic dictates we avoid the ""failed project"" trap. The Archive is different if we use professional contractors, though delivery windows can slip.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Shizue. The Archive is the only one that doesn't add a permanent, unmanageable burden to the staff roster.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I feel the Digital Archive is the kindest choice for the long term.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I can accept the Archive, as it extends our reach digitally since the buses are gone.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Rin,,"I still think it's boring, but if everyone hates the other ones...","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,It is the only proposal that aligns with our financial constraints and staffing reality.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Minako,,It is the most pragmatic choice.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am happy with this.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,4,talk,Rin,,"Fine, as long as we do it right this time!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,A sensible conclusion.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,4,talk,Minako,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
